  <para style="h">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Qiesalonijia</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Qie</para>
  <para style="mt">Qiesalonijia Kunlade Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Seila</char>, <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> ghurelie Ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai xianxin giesan <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>i jiohuide xin huaizho. Tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qiesalonijia Jiohuide Oluzhi Mafan Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Bijien ta ashighalade oluzhi Hudade chan mafan kieliezho. Onxian giekude tai qiizhi kieliezho. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Bijien mai Ada Hudai melie tai izhigie jilazhi kieliezho. Ta xianxin giekughala giesan wilie, orezhi khishulasan, pse mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai panjizhi rennai giesei jilazhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Huda oresan gaijiula, tai sunghusei bijien mejiene. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Bijien tande gouxioxini chonjikude zinie kielienghala giesan pusho, nenli, Shenlin, hende xianxin gieku zhugheghala giesan wo. Bijien tanre hhantu bikude tande oluzhi matugie giesei ta goyalane qinchu wo. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Ta bijien, Ezhan mutun qingie giezhi heikui fugiede shouiliuzhe Shenlin banman giedene daolini bayasuzhi jienliewo. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Ingiese <char style="png">Maqidun</char>, <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maqidun, Yagaiyashi Xila gojiani beimien, nanmiende wo.</char></note> orondedu xianxin giesan kunlade yanzi uzheghawo. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Ezhanyi kielien tai hhense chonji khizhezhi zinie <char style="png">Maqidun</char>, <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>de pusho, gochude man chonji kuruwo. Ta Hudai xianxin giesan xioxii gochui kunla man mejiese bijien yama kielieku biyo uwo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Ta matugiezhi goude bijienyi jienliesei, pse nigiedalai bendadene amitu, zhen Hudai shunjisei hhela goyane kielienduzho. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Pse ta asiman jierese ireku Hudai Kewonni sagheizho giene. Hheshi Huda fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo, jianlai ireku Hudai hokurukuse matanyi jiuine.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Qiesalonijiade Giesan Wilie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Gaijiula, bijien tai oronde irese zoin ulie qiikui pusho. Enei ta goyalane qinchu wo. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Ta mejiesan mutun bijien <char style="png">Feilibi</char>de bikude kunla bijienyi heizhi shizheghawoma, ingieliuzhe mai Huda ogisan danzighala kunla hende fandui gieliuzhe Hudai gouxioxii tande kieliezhi ogiwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Bijien tande surughazhi kieliekude codasei, ganjin witu zhughe, piendakughala ese giezho. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Khareidene bijien kieliekude Huda bijienyi chenren giezhi gouxioxini deilaghasan kun wo giezhi kunlai bayasughane ese giezho. Mai zhughei uzhesan Hudai bayasughane giezho. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Bijien seighan kielienghala ese kieliezho, tanxin gieku zhugheghalaye ese giezho. Enei ta mejiene, Hudaye ganzhen beine. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6-7"/>Bijien Mexihani shitu danlachenlade tai melie qienli winema, goyane taye hao, kunlaye hao kuaighane ese giezho. Bijien tai dunda renyi zhugheghala ana kesilane qiezheku mutun giezho. <verse eid="1TH 2:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Bijien tande hende orezhi zinie Hudai gouxioxini ogiku pusho, lien goya aminneye ogiku duran wo. Tashi bijien ingiezhi oresan wo.<verse eid="1TH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Gaijiula, bijien khishulazhi shouku giesei ta mejiene. Bijien tande Hudai gouxioxini chonjikude ta kiemade achan ulie ogine giezhi xieni udu wilie giezho. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Ta xianxin giesan kunlade bijien giesanshi zhigui, gundanni wo, yama kieliekuni uwo. Enende ta ganzhen bei, Hudaye ganzhen beine. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Ada kesiladene giesan mutun <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>bijien tande sidaghazhi surughazhi goude fenfulasei ta mejiene. Ingiezhi giekushi goyane gojiade, famade urusan Huda tai heshide gieghane giezho.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Bijien pse Hudade chan mafan kielieku dounie yenyinshi ene wo. Ta bijiense Hudai kielienyi jienliekude kunni kielien wo uye giedene Hudai kielien wo giezho. Hhe shuhua Hudai kielien enbene. Ene kielien ta xianxin giesan kunlade zoin wine. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Gaijiulaya, <char style="png">Yudaya</char> orondedu Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giesan Hudai jiohuini kunlai <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlase heisanyi shouisan mutun taye goya kunlase heisanyi shouiwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Ene <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i, xienzhilai alazhi bijienyi tou khireighawo. Hhela Hudai ese bayasughazhi jien kunlare duitou gholuwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Hhela bijienyi niman kunlade ulie chonjighazhi ulie jiuighane giezho. Hhelai zui izhi olodozhi duruse Hudai hokuku zuihoude hhelani jiere bouzhewo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Pse Qiesalonijiani Jiohuii Ochirane Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Gaijiula, bijien zhanshi jiere tanse danxinrase beye danxinrazhoma, zhughe ese danxinrazho. Bijien tai chujiegheku hende duralazho. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Ingiese bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> 1 lianhui tai uzhele echine giese Ibilisi bijienyi duiwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> pse irekude bijien hhei melie panjiku, bayasuku, kuaighaku jianlishi yan wo? Ta pushonu? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Tashijiu bijienyi kuaiku, bayasuku wo!<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Ingiese bijien bazilie dadene goyane <char style="png">Yajien</char>de feilieye giezhi jiejin gie, <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/><char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni tai hhende peizhi echighawo. Hheshi mai gaijiu wo. Bijienre hhantu Mexihani gouxioxii chonjizhi Hudade wilie giesan kun wo. Hhei echighakushi tai khiduzheghazhi xianxin gieku jiere zhichi gieghane giezho. <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Ingiese enezighan heiku shiqin dundase tai nieda ulie gojiolughane giezho. Matande heiku shiqin jinjisei ta goyalane mejiene. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Bijien tanre hhantu bikude matande heiku shiqin irekui tande melieshi kieliezhi daowo. Ede qintui gholusei ta mejiene. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Ingiese bi pse bazilie dadene <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni peizhi tai xianxin gieku matugiezho giezhi daqinlaghale echiwo. Hhe miichen tai miizhi bijien khishulasan wilielani belien gholughakuse ayizho.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> jian tai hhense iredene tai xianxin gieku, oreku gouxioxini bijiende kieliewo. Da kieliezhi ta chan bijienyi bayasuzhi jilazho. Bijien tai chujieghene gieku mutun taye bijienyi chujieghene giezho. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ingiese gaijiula, bijiende kunnan, heiku olon biliuzhe ta xianxin giesan yenyin jiere bijien bayasuzho. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Ta Ezhanyi miende beizhi undanlase bijien ede amiturawo. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Bijien mai Hudai melie tai yenyin jiere hende bayasuzho. Eneni Hudade matugie mafan kieliene? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Bijien tai ochirazhi uye kurusan tai xianxin giekuni kurughane giezhi xieni udu Hudai hende xiahua giezho.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Mai Ada Huda, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> moni keighadene bijienyi zhijie tai hhende echigha gie. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Pse bijien tande olon oreku mutun Ezhan tande oreku zhughei ologhan ogizhi durughadene tai nieniedene oregha gie, jien kunladeye oregha gie. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Ingiese zhughei tai khiduzheghazhi mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> soyuji shentularene hhantu irekude mai Ada Hudai melie zhiguitu yama kielieku witu gholugha gie.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Hudai Bayasughazhi Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Ingiese gaijiula, zuihoude kielieye, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende bijien tai xiahua giezhi tande sughazhi kielieye. Ta bijiense surusan mutun Hudai bayasughazhi gie. Ta ijin giezhoma, pse ologhoni izhigie gie. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Bijien Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i qienlighala tande yan minlin ogisei ta mejiene. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Hudai isishi ene wo, tai zhiguini gholughane giezho. Lon kijieku, pse qimutu zuilase gholode beighazhi <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>jien kunde goya beyene hanshiliezhi ganjin, zhiguide giekuni mejieghane. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Hudai tani dasan niman kun mutun lon gieku nefuxinni daghazhi hu ulie gieghane. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Ene shiqin jiere xianxin giesan gaijiulade piendazhi pienyi bu zhanji. Bijien melieshi tande kieliezhi hende jingao giesan mutun Ezhan qimutu zui fanjisan kunlai faine. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Huda matanyi urukushi ganjin wini bu giezhi, zhiguide gie giezho. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Ingiese ene sughasei ulie chenliechen kunshi kunni ulie chenlieku pusho, tande goya Shenlinne ogisan Hudai uye chenliezho.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Gaijiulade oreku shiqinni kieliese tande xin huaiku biyo uwo. Nieniedene orekuni ta goyane Hudase suruzho. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Ta <char style="png">Maqidun</char>ni gaijiulade man shuhua ingiezhi giezho. Gaijiula, bijien tande xiahua gieye, ta pse ologhonni gie. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Bijien tande fenfulasan mutun ta xiacha giezhi udune nanrande daogha. Goya shiqinlane gonji. Khaghalane wilielai gie. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Qingiese ghadanedu kun ta giesanlai uzhese zunzhun giene, taye kiemade ulie kouine.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ezhan Xiajian Gieku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Gaijiula, bijienyi duranshi hhe fugusan kunlai shiqinni ta mejiese gou wo. Ingiese hhe xiwon wichen kun mutun zhughetai ulie otune. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Matan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> duya ijiedene aminne olusanyi xianxin giese <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giedene duya ijiesan kunlai Huda <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ghala hhantu udurukuiye xianxin giene. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Bijien Ezhanyi kielienyi tande kielieye. Ezhan pse irekude matan amitu kun hhe fugusan kunlase melieshida dane. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Nie minlin xiaise fugie qienxien waradazhi Hudai labai shenqi dunda Ezhan asiman jierese qinsi irene. Ingiekude Mexihani xianxin giedene fugusan kun xien aminne olune. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Ingiedene bijien amitu kunyi hhelare hhantu olien jiere deila echi asiman jiere Ezhanyi ochirane. Ingiedene chanqi Ezhanre hhantu soune. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Ingiese ta enezighan kielienghala nieniedene surughazhi kielie.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Gaijiula, ene shiqin giezhe fashen giekui tande xin huaiku biyo uwo. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Ezhanni udushi ghughei xienidei ireku mutun mejie dakude irekui ta qinchu wo. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Kunla "Pinnan wo, yama shiqin uwo." giezhi kieliekude menzhali hhelade zeinan kuzhi irene. Biereila kewosi olukude otuku niekielien wo. Kiema anda dane.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Gaijiula, ingieseye ta kharanide uwo. Hhe ireku udu tande ghughei mutun ulie irene. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Ta manshi gonni kewosi, uduni kewosi wo. Matanshi xieninughun pusho, kharaninughunye pusho. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Ingiese matan kunla mutun bu hhunturadene goude jinxin gieye. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Hhunturachen kun xienidei hhunturane. Sudochen kun xienidei sudone. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Matanshi udunughun wo, indan jinxin gieye. Xianxin gieku, oreku kuijiani musizhi jiuiku xiwonni toukuini zhoye. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Huda mai sunghuse faine ese giezho. Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi jiuine giezho. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha matande oluzhi duya ijiese bugon matan amitu kun, fugusan kun man hheghala hhantu udu daoghane giezho. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Ingiese ta chan gieku mutun nieniedene surughazhi kieliezhi nieniene hendagha.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihou Surughaku Kielien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Gaijiula, bijien tai xiahua gieye, tande oluzhi khishulasan kunlai zunji. Hhela Ezhanyi miende tai gonjizhi sughazho. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Hhela giesan wilieni yenyinghala ta hhelade orezhi goude zunzhun gie. Ta nienierene heqishi.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Gaijiula, bijien pse tande sughazhi kielieye, hhe lansunlade jingao gie, danzi widasan kunlade hunlazhi kielie, zhoreliesan kunlai fei, soyuji kunlade rennai gie. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Ta kienliuzhe ijinyo doghunnide doghunni bu kharei. Nieniedene, ashighalade gouni giekude chan xiacha gie.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Ta chan bayasu, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>bu beidene onxian gie, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>yan shiqindeliuzhe mafan kielie. Eneshi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro tande olusan Hudai isi wo.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Shenlinni wiliei bu danla. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Hudai kielienyi kieliese uzhezhi bu xinie. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Yandeliuzhe shiizhi uzhe, gounii barei, <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>shiheni doghunnise gholode bei.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Pinnan ogisan Huda qinsi tai zhengiejia zhiguitu gholugha gie. Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha irekude tai ruhher, jinshen, beyei man bouizhi yama kieliekui widagha gie. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Tai urusanshi kekaoni wo. Hhe ijinyo chenjighane.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Gaijiula, bijiende oluzhi onxian gie. <verse eid="1TH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Zhughesene jien gaijiulade kielien asa. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Bi Ezhanyi niereghala tande minlin xiaiye. Ene xinni soyuji gaijiulade man onshizhi chenliegha.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai nenjien tanre hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
